        </semantic:textAnnotation>
        <semantic:textAnnotation id="_6b97bc8f-56d6-47e2-8be4-b57873daae02">
            <semantic:text>The gateway doesn’t decide — it waits for whichever event happens first.
The token travels only down the path of the event that occurs first.
It’s perfect for modeling real-time, reactive processes (delivery, travel, or apps with countdowns).</semantic:text>
        </semantic:textAnnotation>
    </semantic:process>
